# What Vercel must NOT publish (audit 18 Nov 2026, SA-12 / AUT-12).
# The site is static: every file left in the deploy is served to anyone who types its address.
# Pages only load /index.html, the app folders, /lib, /assets, /signatures and the three root scripts
# (supabase-config.js, owner-config.js, error-monitor.js) — tests/vercelignore.spec.js proves it on every run.
# Same syntax as .gitignore. A leading "/" means "only at the top of the site".

/supabase/
/docs/
/tests/
/scripts/
/.claude/
/.github/
/test-results/
/playwright-report/
/node_modules/

/package.json
/package-lock.json
/playwright.config.js
/.gitignore

*.md
*.py
.DS_Store
